<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective from July 31 to August 6 the 1997:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 64.60</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 68.80</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 70.74</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 74.29</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$173.28</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$129.96</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 96.77</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 25.19</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.52</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 27.77</p>
</text>
